    ! #245: "Citations can now appear as numbered badges beside matching titles in assistant answers" - This repeats the inline citation feature already described above. The facts support the delivered feature, but the output presents it as a separate feature; the facts describe one implementation, not two distinct badge features.
    ! #218: "unless the assistant has already checked it" - The forced check is skipped if a check has already run in this run; the facts do not say an earlier check by the assistant exempts a later retrieval from the force-once check. The check is guaranteed once after retrieval, not necessarily once per retrieval.
